{
  "id": "ACT.27",
  "number": "27",
  "bookId": "ACT",
  "reference": "Tlehhma'Aá Ya/Abuuse 27",
  "verseCount": 44,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "27",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "27",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár hara'aya kawa oó' tawa aa'aá kawaan ar baraá tlawi ay Italia. Paulo kunguri duúx, nee mukduú hatlá' taa tsegiít, kiri qaás dabaá heeko ta bay Yulio. Inós a geeraharusmoó daqtá askaárír múk Roma, daqtadá' ta bay «Daqtá Agusto.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana tsa/amán baraá miringamooko ta bay Adiramito. Miringamoodá' amór i kay a baraá gixsadaá afaá tlawi awa yaamaá Asia. Tari tlawaán. Aristarko, heé gixsár Tesalonike ar baraá yaamaá Makedonia, nee atén ti koomaán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Looaytleérós ana hardahaán Sidoni. Yulio Paulo guri hhooeemaá i tleéhh, iri ya/án iwa mulqeerós artá ay, as inooín kuwa alee/iisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tari didá' wa tlawaán, tari waarahhaán ar baraá tlawi bihhaá doó /iyáy awa Kipro, as fur'a kawa ilaguwaan, asma fur'a ka ló' wa ur baraá tlawto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlawi kari waarahhaán, tawa nakaa/aán dír yaamaá Kilikiaro nee Pamfilia, tlawi kari waarahhaán ay dír gixsár Mira ar baraá yaamaá Likia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Didaádae geeraharusmoó askaari miringamo nguri sláy oo Aleksandriár daáhh. Miringamoodá' i Italiár káy. Atén tiri gawaadií tsa/aás ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana tseegimamiisaán aaiiwo. Deelór yaariir kay hhe'eesaán, tari hardahaán gixsár Nido ar qitla. Fur'a tina ak il/aán, tari bihhaá yaamaá Krete oohaán, tawa waarahhaan ar Salmone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tari kumiitaán afaá tlawtár alé. Tari hardahaán ar slahha'amaayér yaariir dirka ta bay «Afaá tlawi awa Hhoohhoá'.» Diirí ka saweeká dír gixsár Lasearo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tari didá' wa hootaán deelór yaariire. Gawaá adoorihe a tsaxwá ur bar aga kumiitaán aaiikae. Asma hamí tam deelór Gwaawito aa waaráhh. Paulo axweesantí kari káh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iri oó', «Án ngi slaá' aaiirén kukaáká' diirí wa tleemu i tsaxwaá koná'. Xooslár yaariir a qwaareesaán, nee miringamo, ala tam slafingwrén oo kilá'.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala geeraharusmoó askaári axweesanoó heé miringamoó madiít, nee daqaarmoó miringamo, guna axaamiís ta oo Paulowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala didaádá' ta i dirii'i i hariindaaká hotaango qoomár tsaaqwaro. Gawaá adoorihe múk yaariír iri oó', «Gusé', waarahhamu bura aleeslawaán a waarahhaán ay Foiniki, as tawa hootaan qoomár tsaaqwaro.» Didá' an afaá tlawi awa yaamaá Krete. Diirí ina ganá' baskwá al /uwa, nee slám ina ganá' /iikwá al /uwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár fur'ár baskú daahh iwa iimu/uún fukukueeliingo ar tseegamis, tay ooaán daxta hardahamu u aleeslawaán as fur'aarí. Miringamo kuri gweér, tari tláy, tari kumiít ar afaá yaamaá Krete ar adoodá' taa aleesláy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deelór niina iwa waaráhh, fur'ár bambaao iri /uurúr fukukueeliín, niri amór yaamaá kaahaár wa tleér ar /uuru. Bambaaodá' a tidá' ta babay «Bambaaór /iikwá al da/aáw.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bambaaodá' miringamo guna dalá/. Kari tsaahhaán adór miringamo nee fur'a tlaampa'aamisuwo tir aleeslay'aaká. Miringamo sa daawimituwo kuri mawaán as kuwa harahuwahuwi nee fur'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tari hardahaán amór yaamuukaari niina awa tla/ángw tlawi, awa ta babay Kauda. Tari bihhaá baskuú ar oohaán, amoodá' fur'a kawa ilaá/. Miringamoodá' niiná ta huwahuwi nee kudá' úr, kuri aleeslawaán kuwa tsa/aasaan gawaá miringamoodá' úr, ala ar ma/iís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miringamoodá' niiná kuwa hhe'eés tsa/aasaro, him'e kari waarahhaás ar baraá guruú miringamoodá' úr, kuri tseega hhe'eés as kuwa /aatleesi. Tari da'ayuút fur'a ngiwa huwahup ay dír afaá yaamaá Libya, ay dirka ma'aay kiwa niiná, didá' ta bay Sirti. Warqamaá uren awa fur'a baqamiingw kiri /aareés, as miringamo kuwa tseegisi nee fur'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala fur'a tina ló'wa daawitimís, looár na tleeri huwa kari kwakwaahhaán baraá tlawi as huwa kawa /aareesaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bál tám xooslár miringamo kari kwakwaáhh baraá tlawi ar dabaaín awa kilá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deelór yaariir iri waaráhh, tsee/amá nee tsatse/ ugwa araaniiká, nee fur'a iri lówa kumít ar /uuru. Tam alhhe'eesaywo harahhifór tawa ba/aman iri fák.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deelór yaariire tawa iwiiwiít ar qwari, Paulo iri tla/angw'íní sihhiít, iri oó', «Hhawaáte, qoomár aníng niwa oó' a tlawanaaká yaamaá Kretero alók ina iiárií qasé'. Muruuwí yaariír geera alók aa hhitiruutiiká nee aa qwaariiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala hamí nu baw, gur'e gawdeesaak. Asma tam heé wák i qwaariiká dirhunge, ala a har miringamo kilós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma xweeraaká' laarí malaykamoó Munguúdá' aníng naa haratlintií', slám ni sluufmiis, nina bihhieé' i sihhiít, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iri báy, ‹Paulo, ma da'ayumitaar. Kuúng gár tuwa hariím an sihhít geeraá waawutmoó múk Roma. Nee qaytsiít, slafíngw mukwí sleémeero baraá miringamií dirií' oo aa'aá kaw dinkwa nee kuúng, Mungú gu ba/amis as kuúng.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, hhawaáte, gur'e gawdesaak, asma án Mungú ugwa haratlintií' adoodá' tinda dir'eé' oó' adór ir tleehharút. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala miringamoorén aqo kun huuw nee fur'a ay dír yaamuukaari kaahaar awa baraá tla/ángw tlawi, iri iisi'ín gawaadií alé.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
