          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xweeraá bál mibaá nee tsiyáhh ti qo ar harweriirín badu sleémeero baraá tlawtá Mediteraneár wa ale, qoomár dakiingo, múk baraá miringamoó wa gadiyuús, kawa xui geeraawo taa tseewúy yaamaá kaahaar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlaa/ano kuri tseék gawaá ságw hhutlmo, kuri /aytiís baraá tlawi, as saweemaá tlawi kiwa tsaahhi. Kari tsaáhh ar har afi qoomoó miíta mibeeri tsiyáhh. Siiwár niina iwa waaráhh, tay malé tlaa/anoó /aytiís, saweema kiri tsaáhh a miíta mibeeri tám. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tari da'ayuút as miringamo iwa iisi'in gawaá tlaa/ár baraá tlawi. Tlaa/aá tsiyáhh awa miringamo ilaa/aro ngu aleeslaawá', kiri /aytiís baraá tlawi, awa taa tseék alaá miringamo. Tari firirín as looa niwa tleer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala mukdá' baraá miringamoó wa gadiyuús iri guwoó slaá' as baraá miringamoó úr kiwa geexay. Miringamoodá' niiná kuri aweeriís baraá tlawi, adór múk tlaa/aá /aytisár slaá', kudá' miringamoó ilaa/aamá' amór ságw miringamoó wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo geeraharusmoó askaári guri báy, «Mukwí bir baraá miringamoó wa iwiwiitiiká, kuungá' a ba/aanda'aaká.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy askaári him'eedá' miringamoodá' niiná kura tseék, gari tsát, miringamo iri huú'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár iimi iwa piinsli'iimit, Paulo muu sleémeero guri harhheehhe'eés iwa /ayin, iri oó', «Ay laarí deelo a mibaá nee tsiyáhh tawa daamaraandé' nee tawa gwaawiwiindé', tam aga gaa /agi'iiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe án kuungá' nun harhhheehhe'eés, muruú /ayma /ayaak, asma an gár tar slafa'. Asma tam oo wák baraá tla/angwhunge, se'eemír sagós i qwatká.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoorí ooaro ngiwa hhe'eés, mukatmo guri taataáhh, Mungú guri dír geeraá muu sleémeeró wa sluufiís. Mukaatmo guri parhhamiís, /aymaro guri iimu/ún. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sleémeero tari gur'e kwaá/, nee inooín sleeme tari /ayín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee ateédá' baraá miringamoó i diriiá' a har tsiirér tsár nee mibeeraá faanqw nee lahhoó'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tawa aáx, angaáno kuri kwaáhh baraá tlawi, as iiloeema kiwa /aareesi baraá miringamoowo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Looa ina tleér mukdá' miringamoó madiít yaamuudá' taa i hardáh kaa tsaahhiiká. Ala gár taa ár a qul/ír ma'aá taa doogiye' nee yaamaá kaahaar awa naa tlapiitiye'. Tari al'axweés as miringamo kuwa amoodií hardahaasi bira ya/aán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Him'eedá' tlaa/aá koom kari tsaát, kari máy baraá tlawi. Nee him'eedá' miringamo kur madiiti kari slakwekwe'eés. Warqamooduú fur'ár ila/aám kuri tleés amór ságw miringamoó wa ale, as fur'a miringamo nguwa geerií surkus, tari tseewúy afaá tlawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala tawa hardáh dirka ma'aá tlawi ti dogiitiya', miringamo iri iisi'ín gawaá hhasaangwduú baraá tlawi. Ságw miringamo iri iisi'ín, iri ló'wa nag'aát. Bartá alu kari tuu'uút nee /uuruú gwaanduú ma'aay, iri fee/ít.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee askaári gár aa slá', a mukdá' sleémeero taa tsegiít kuwa tsu/i, as tam oo wák dir'ine miwa waaraáhh ar baraá ma'aay ar qumburu/umit, iri goow. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala geeraharusmoó askaári Paulo guna ba/amisár wa slaá', askaáridá' gari ilaá/, adoodá' ta slai makawa tleéhh. Ala iri hara'ayín as mukdá' qumburu/umit gu aleesláw, tawa geerií /akumiiti baraá tlawi, nee ta yaamaá kaahaárí hardihi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee mukdá' aa meet, bahh'alé i tsa/an gawaá peehháy nee bahh'alé gawaá parhheemaá hatlá' awa miringamo. Gawaá adoorihe sleémeero tari yaamaá kaahaárí hardahaán ar saxareema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
